{
  "_about": "The one source of the Vision System look (ARCHITECTURE.md 2.3, UI-UX-SPEC.md 7). tools/tokens/gen_tokens.py generates dotnet/Studio/Theme/Tokens.g.axaml from it (CSS for the browser dashboard later). Colours have one value per theme: dark (default), light and highContrast. Status colours always go with their shape: ok ✓, ng ✗, warn !, duplicate ⧉, stopped ‖, info i. Sizes are one compact density for every role, for touch, mouse and keyboard together (owner, 2026-10-31; UI-UX-SPEC.md principle 3). Chart colours are the series colours of charts (principle 15), never a status. Instrument colours (hud, hudDim) are for keyboard focus, hover and scan lines only, never a status (requirements 17.15 NXT-01). Typefaces are three roles (NXT-02): display (titles, buttons, the OK/NG word), body (all text in every language; scripts it lacks fall back to the listed system fonts) and mono (every number, tabular); the three families are embedded in Vision Studio (SIL Open Font License 1.1).",
